  {
    "key": "component::hassio::issues::issue_addon_deprecated_arch_addon::fix_flow::step::addon_execute_remove::description",
    "key_id": "818301561",
    "translation_id": "7966897595",
    "en": "App {addon} only supports architectures and/or machines which are no longer supported by Home Assistant. It will stop working in a future release.\n\nSelecting **Submit** will uninstall this deprecated app and permanently delete everything in its private data folder, including any databases, credentials and other internal state it kept there. Create a [backup]({backup_url}) first if you might need that data later.\n\nAlternatively, you can check [Home Assistant help]({help_url}) and the [community forum]({community_url}) for alternatives to migrate to.",
    "sv": "Appen {addon} stöder endast arkitekturer och/eller maskintyper som Home Assistant inte längre stöder. Den slutar fungera i en framtida version.\n\nOm du väljer **Bekräfta** avinstalleras appen och allt innehåll i dess privata datamapp raderas permanent. Det omfattar databaser, inloggningsuppgifter och andra interna data. Skapa en [säkerhetskopia]({backup_url}) i förväg om du kan behöva uppgifterna senare.\n\nBesök också [Home Assistant-hjälpen]({help_url}) och [communityforumet]({community_url}) för att hitta alternativ att migrera till.",
    "verification_method": "Lokalise API live readback + Home Assistant Core source review",
    "verified_date": "2026-11-27",
    "status": "saved-and-read-back",
    "source_revision": "1d07105b760c73093145526a51758938e87cc658"
  },
